                "category": "interaction",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>The wolf's keen sense of sight can see through both mundane and magical hindrances when they have their sights set on their prey. The wolf ignores their prey's concealment if they're visible. If their prey is invisible, the wolf treats their invisibility as concealment instead.</p>"
