                    "value": null
                },
                "category": "defensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature within reach of the wolf's jaws attempts to move out of reach</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The hungersome wolf attempts a jaws Strike against the triggering creature. On a hit, they disrupt the triggering creature's move action.</p>"
