        {
            "_id": "WhfkR9WHqziAPxcF",
            "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/OneAction.webp",
            "name": "Stalk Prey",
            "sort": 700000,
            "system": {
                "actionType": {
                    "value": "action"
                },
                "actions": {
                    "value": 1
                },
                "category": "defensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>The hungersome wolf designates a single sapient creature they can smell and hear as their prey. The hungersome wolf gains a +2 circumstance bonus to Perception checks to [[/act seek]] their prey and Survival checks to [[/act track]] their prey. The wolf gains an additional reaction each round they can use only for Run If You Can against their prey.</p>\n<p>If the wolf uses Stalk Prey again, any creature they'd designated as their prey is no longer their prey.</p>"
                },
                "publication": {
                    "license": "OGL",
                    "remaster": false,
                    "title": ""
                },
                "rules": [],
