                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>This functions as @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.Change Shape], except the hungersome wolf must transform into the last creature they Swallowed Whole. This doesn't change their Speed or their attack and damage bonuses, but it might change the damage type their Strikes deal (typically to bludgeoning). The transformation lasts until the hungersome wolf takes 20 or more damage from a single ability, attack, or spell.</p>"
